{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104223007857-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104231348\"/><p>貨車當時由英皇道轉入書局街。(余宏基攝)</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今晚(4日)10時13分，一輛中型貨車由英皇道左轉入書局街時，其左邊車頭懷疑撞倒一名44歲過路女子。事主捱撞後昏迷，由救護車送往東區醫院救治。執法部門正調查意外原因，不排除有人不遵守交通規則引致意外。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.333874+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:30:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.730260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:16.781826+00:00","content_hash":"719ee93b70c7efef72f712b906336ab0d68c8e06a6f02223b2803a1a4d8d698d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.333874+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}